%%{init: {'themeVariables': {'lineColor': '#111111'}}}%%
flowchart TB
    subgraph Sources["Knowledge Sources"]
        direction TB
        LocalDocs["Local docs<br/>architecture, contracts,<br/>workflows, ADRs"]
        TrustedURLs["Trusted online sources<br/>LangChain, LangGraph,<br/>Anthropic, OpenAI docs"]
        AgentOutcomes["Agent outcomes<br/>what worked, what failed,<br/>patterns discovered"]
        UserPrefs["User preferences<br/>decisions made,<br/>style choices"]
    end

    subgraph Store["Shared Knowledge Store<br/>knowledge_store.sqlite3"]
        direction TB
        SharedDocs["(shared, docs)<br/>architecture + standards"]
        SharedTrusted["(shared, trusted)<br/>online reference docs"]
        AgentLearnings["(agent, id, learnings)<br/>per-agent experience"]
        UserMemory["(user, id, preferences)<br/>per-user preferences"]
    end

    subgraph Agents["All Agents - Read + Write"]
        direction TB
        FactoryBrain["Factory Brain<br/>reads architecture<br/>writes decisions"]
        ArmyOrch["Army Orchestrator<br/>reads routing patterns<br/>writes routing outcomes"]
        ATL["AI Tech Lead<br/>reads coding patterns<br/>writes task outcomes"]
        FutureAgents["Future agents<br/>add as they join the army"]
    end

    subgraph KeeperSection["Knowledge Keeper"]
        direction TB
        Keeper["Indexes, deduplicates,<br/>and compacts on schedule"]
    end

    LocalDocs -->|ingested on change| SharedDocs
    TrustedURLs -->|crawled on schedule| SharedTrusted
    AgentOutcomes -->|written after each task| AgentLearnings
    UserPrefs -->|written during conversation| UserMemory

    SharedDocs <-->|search + write| FactoryBrain
    SharedTrusted <-->|search| FactoryBrain
    AgentLearnings <-->|search + write| FactoryBrain

    SharedDocs <-->|search| ArmyOrch
    AgentLearnings <-->|search + write| ArmyOrch

    SharedDocs <-->|search| ATL
    SharedTrusted <-->|search| ATL
    AgentLearnings <-->|write| ATL

    AgentLearnings <-->|write| FutureAgents

    Keeper -->|re-index, deduplicate, compact| Store

    style Store fill:#e8f4e8,stroke:#5a9e5a
    style Keeper fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e6a817
